# GitHub L2 index (xiaolin-gateway) — category: platform · ADR-0009
#
# Environments: tencent-101 (auto CD default) · aliyun-121 (manual dispatch only)
#
# --- Secrets (required, same names in each Environment) ---
#   SERVER_HOST / SERVER_USER / SERVER_PASSWORD
#
# --- Variables (optional) ---
#   ENABLE_OBSERVABILITY=true|false
#     Default when unset: tencent-101 → true, aliyun-121 → false
#     When true, CD appends observability-compose.yml to COMPOSE_FILE
#
# Repo-level SERVER_* are deprecated after Environments are populated.
#
# Sync (human terminal; see docs/env/README.md):
#   sync.sh env sync-github --project xiaolin-gateway --environment tencent-101
#   sync.sh env sync-github --project xiaolin-gateway --environment aliyun-121
#
# Or set ENABLE_OBSERVABILITY in GitHub → Settings → Environments → Variables.
